			<div class="content" id="post-content-4541069">
									

<p>This is my article for theme 1 of the 2020 Jamcon &#8212; it was &quot;EXPLOSIONS&quot;, so I obviously went with the Principle of Explosion. Obviously. A complete explanation of this particular disjunctive delight can be found on <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Principle_of_explosion">Wikipedia</a>.</p>
<p>The image is a composite of <strong><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sky.jpg">this</a></strong> and <strong><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hot_Air-Balloon_(Unsplash).jpg">this</a></strong>, both from Wikimedia Commons.</p>

